    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>(3rd Level)</em></p><p><em>“Nice try. Logged.”</em></p><p>Once per Soma Break, when an effect would:</p><ul><li><p>Rewrite memory</p></li><li><p>Alter historical meaning</p></li><li><p>Retcon an outcome</p></li><li><p>Falsify an established record</p></li></ul><p>You may declare:</p><blockquote><p><strong>The record stands.</strong></p></blockquote><p>The effect may function locally (illusion, altered perception, etc.), but it <strong>cannot alter Precedent or long-term consequence.</strong></p><h3>Cost</h3><p>No Surge required (limited use).</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Using Immutable Record against major narrative forces may accelerate <strong>Noise</strong>, especially if overused to block organic resolution.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
